 than April 15, 2025 at 3:00 PM PST.General Order 58. Persons granted access to court proceedings held by telephone or videoconference are reminded that photographing, recording, and rebroadcasting of court proceedings, including screenshots or other visual copying of a hearing, is absolutely prohibited.Zoom Guidance and Setup: https://www.cand.uscourts.gov/zoom/. Status Conference set for 4/18/2025 10:00 AM in San Francisco, - Videoconference Only before Judge Charles R. Breyer. Amended Pleadings due by 6/6/2025. Motions due by 8/8/2025.. Signed by Judge Charles R. Breyer on 3/14/2025. (ls, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 3/14/2025) (Entered: 03/14/2025)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/419317598/", "id": 419317598, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/69124813/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/433236149/", "id": 433236149, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/69124813/22/beaver-v-evry-jewels-incorporated/", "date_created": "2025-03-14T10:33:34.950064-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-12-22T08:46:00.205871-08:00", "sha1": "", "page_count": null, "file_size": null, "filepath_local": null, "filepath_ia": "", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "", "ocr_status": null, "date_upload": null, "document_number": "22", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "035025515588", "is_available": false, "is_free_on_pacer": null, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "Joint Case Management Statement", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2025-03-14T10:33:34.883091-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-12-22T08:46:00.173988-08:00", "date_filed": "2025-03-14", "time_filed": "10:09:49", "entry_number": 22, "recap_sequence_number": "2025-03-14.001", "pacer_sequence_number": 65, "description": "JOINT CASE MANAGEMENT STATEMENT and Proposed Order filed by Katie Beaver. (Franzini, Simon